{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "f6bb05c33a0c3f3ccc095950b2126722e696d665743bdd2be04e0f4c75186a8a", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nちょうどいいところに。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n您来得正好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "eb807dfce73c2e7ad84731ccf648d3519ef10e4aca4f867dc91c1358e710d9e0", "ja": "お疲れ様です、青羽さん。\n何かありましたか？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n是有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "e6db105f045c1730e8bf763cb4ac8040d2ebe69f998fc2f7a51bbacc4d468884", "ja": "えへへ、大した用事じゃないんですけど。実は友達と、\n『おとぎの国の物語』の映画を観に行ってきたんです♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，没什么大事。其实我和朋友一起去看了《童话王国的故事》这部电影♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "067fd5ac8bade3afb8a9d10f4bea86105c539f1b64231b2e90edcd5948a3086c", "ja": "えっ？　でも青羽さんは、\n試写会でみんなと一緒に見たはずじゃ……。", "zh": "咦？可是青羽小姐不是应该已经和大家一起在试映会上看过了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "5c98d8283855866ac78c7a29ead2324623280770838a8646a2cd0a37300a97ac", "ja": "はい！　でも、もう1回見たくなっちゃったんです。\n違う劇場で見ても、とってもかわいかったですよ！", "zh": "是的！不过，我已经忍不住想再看1遍了。即使在不同的影院观看，也还是特别可爱哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "90bfc6d1abc05085ca60d3c03e1b7e3276de98f046d0b25309af01296abeb9c0", "ja": "友達も、ファンになったって言ってくれました。\n次の映画も、一緒に行く約束をしたんですよ♪", "zh": "朋友也说她成了粉丝。\n我们还约好了下次一起去看电影呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d78b474c190e9262ddbe961b6cae61acec4edb627c6c365318e647c69b87a6c1", "ja": "ハードルが上がっている……でも、ありがたいですね。\n期待に応えられるよう、頑張ります！", "zh": "标准提高了……不过，真是令人感激。\n为了不辜负期待，我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "6a5be8623c6f1bdaba5d432134b762c720ad72f071826a7acb1a711bf7f27dea", "ja": "あっ、そうそう。社長さんが、手が空いたら\n事務所に来てほしいって言ってました！", "zh": "啊，对了对了。社长说您有空的话，\n希望您能来一趟事务所！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "6dab5c462e04114a502e78135059f45a563199c35cc35eb67f44005a547c0404", "ja": "{$P$}さんに、とってもいいお話が\nあるそうです。新しいお仕事かもしれませんね♪", "zh": "好像是有非常好的事情要告诉{$P$}先生呢。\n说不定是有新工作了哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "533dfbb10f4200905084d7cf859514273459851fcbba3a7860579421ca640f1d", "ja": "そうですか、わかりました。\nそれじゃ、早速いってきますね！", "zh": "这样啊，我知道了。\n那么，我这就过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "dabe680e1ab7fd7143ec3256863c9ac810a9e36eccb8f6de2f4c4bce8baa16d5", "ja": "は～い、いってらっしゃ～い。\nお仕事がんばってくださいね～。", "zh": "好～的，路上小心～。\n工作加油哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "b498b099894da6c10e7e61184f455426b7fa8050256ca58e7528a3533482f0e4", "ja": "おおっ、これだよ、これこれ。\nほら音無君、見てごらん。いや、懐かしいなぁ！", "zh": "哦哦，就是这个，这个这个。\n来，音无，快看看。哎呀，真让人怀念啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "643ac45cc5cddf3cee0bc93984b8ad514bb5702303716a69d753dc6337433ec0", "ja": "あら？　この写真……。\n社長、サングラスなんかしてましたっけ？", "zh": "哎呀？这张照片……\n社长以前有戴过墨镜什么的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "635f540261d9f3378b162e9f60d6e90ae1d60d5e4b1ac88882af460ec260d842", "ja": "ふっふっふ、昔は私もワルだったんだよ！", "zh": "呵呵呵，以前我也是个坏孩子哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "07f5fa4e35540e8cb905a4c6d9920d67f449c6ddc581c0dd37dad9255475655b", "ja": "お疲れさまです。\nふたりとも、何をしているんですか？", "zh": "辛苦了。\n你们两个在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "d61fce9f6cda97e838ea61c99a2f3b7cad9bfd4807f23931c3ceb33e02b7b478", "ja": "おお君、よく来てくれたね！\n昔のアルバムが出てきたから、見ていたんだ。", "zh": "哦，你来得正好！\n我翻出了以前的相册，正在看呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "07c9088898e2ad3a28301d0f6d323a51cb98fc2360f8484684fe2c4c9ad8285b", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、\n昔はワルだったりしたんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生以前也当过不良少年吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "00bddc1effb0f6ce8a42d1a7e19a7c3b46f9e02ac273f868230d1b9962c4ed5d", "ja": "ワル……？　憧れる気持ちは、なんとなく\nわからなくもないですが……音無さんはどうでしたか？", "zh": "坏人……？虽然我多少能理解那种憧憬的心情……不过，音无小姐以前是怎样的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "e70aeaa3342bed3c664ecbdeb3205a7fb8f2c8403246746205eab0868c8d9d0d", "ja": "えっ、私ですか？　ま、まあ、私も大人ですから、\n色々とあったり、なかったり……。", "zh": "诶？说我吗？这、这个嘛，我也是成年人了，所以嘛，也经历过一些事情，或者其实也没有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "671b5cd3d6b1a4aca786e48843e0ee87cfb4eeafac8d7ba38b25f2aa2e0c6aee", "ja": "なるほど……。\nところで社長、何か話があると聞きましたが。", "zh": "原来如此……\n对了，社长，我听说您有事要跟我说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "d472a9f20392f54c4f9ef62d53f4804034747d371860e737e3bf545f467362ae", "ja": "おお、そうなんだ。先日のオーディションの\n結果が出たと連絡があってね！　例の映画だよ！", "zh": "哦，原来是这样。刚刚联系我说，前几天试镜的结果出来了！就是那部电影！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "351205a1a094e7cc846a236b6cdaf9fb8ae8bf2fb57faf751ccbbd2661e319b3", "ja": "そうだったんですね！\nそれで、結果は……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊！\n那么，结果是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "4c79696506cc9c6c054f55850641e324377bd1ff6162f44d0c68a4f1d0de3bcc", "ja": "出演者は如月千早君、星井美希君。それにエミリー\nスチュアート君、菊地真君、天海春香君の5人だ！", "zh": "出演者是如月千早、星井美希，还有艾米莉·斯图尔特、菊地真、天海春香这5个人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "17181f432c1276d3809605f8c7324919f342e5baea519dfe049603162f60ac42", "ja": "おお！　これは……\nなんとも、斬新な組み合わせですね。", "zh": "哦！这可真是……\n真是个别出心裁的组合呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "f2e397d7205f10bb324eb90e8b379a749661b31b2361c1d0389b80db9ced2c88", "ja": "私も、さっき社長から台本を見せてもらったんです。\nもう……とっても、萌えました！", "zh": "刚才社长也给我看了剧本。\n真是……太萌了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "8863758904c3c2391ff29dbeb8597246a081c38eca6729c77b01fce1e8cee513", "ja": "そうですか！　……え？　萌え？", "zh": "这样啊！……诶？萌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "a16132c02261fd7e45d51052005e8d5e4891d63afd5cf303af6ab8fe93bf55e8", "ja": "そうなんです！\n聞いてください、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "就是这样！\n请听我说，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "b9f9e1eb1ea668943dcbd8d5a687a206ee7cb21aa097335541d92e4444a05dd1", "ja": "エミリーちゃんが演じる『アマリリス』は、\n『小鳥』なんて呼ばれてるんですよ！", "zh": "小艾米莉饰演的《朱顶红》，都被叫作“小鸟”了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1029_101kot", "source_sha256": "2f2a2b5c5a1d124d568f71be9116657ee801a12862531c82029c7ae7d2355bb2", "ja": "ちょっと、恥ずかしいですね……。\n年が年なら私もアマリリス役を……なんて。キャッ！", "zh": "有点不好意思呢……要是年纪合适的话，我也能演阿玛莉莉丝……什么的。呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1030_101kot", "source_sha256": "58f52c6016d4298869ea00acd46a9820b9f1e31b1315f2d5f6ad43f5441bdf7d", "ja": "「今の私は鳥籠の小鳥……ねえ、どこにいるの？\n私は、あなたに会いたい……」なんて、うふふふふっ♪", "zh": "“现在的我只是笼中之鸟……呐，你究竟在哪里？\n好想……见你一面……”开玩笑的，呵呵呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "0473a87d5fd14e7ff5f5ed8aaf3411b5e11b4acec1315926698acc55e5027606", "ja": "音無君も、大分楽しみにしているようだ……。\nかくいう私も、楽しみにしているんだがね！", "zh": "看来音无也相当期待啊……。其实我也很期待呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1032_president", "source_sha256": "bfb6754d4f722af5314ac6f94de97621c02c255e5a43e690466fc553aa693630", "ja": "今回の映画出演は、アイドル諸君にとって新たな挑戦と\nなるだろう。君の力で、成功に導いてくれたまえ！", "zh": "这次出演电影，对各位偶像来说将会是全新的挑战。请用你的力量，引导我们走向成功吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1033_p", "source_sha256": "28bbd78e962d67fc8359d2cc3ddec5e8e95ce7a1fc3c5e0a781dd967a06f85b3", "ja": "はいっ！　アイドル達の新しい可能性を\n切り拓けるよう、頑張ります！", "zh": "好的！我会努力为偶像们开拓新的可能性！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_intro_1034_p", "source_sha256": "416fda0957e6b43655a02dc18abd230b2cecc88ee7903d1a78c6449f2adaae15", "ja": "（アイドル達が主演の、近未来を舞台にしたSF映画\n……どんな作品になるか、今から楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（由偶像们主演、以近未来为舞台的科幻电影……现在就开始期待会拍成什么样了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
